## Interface: 100007, 16001, 11509, 20506, 30403
## Title: Spoken Party Sync
## Notes: Plays Spoken's lines together for players who quest together: started at once, skipped at once, and one voice in the room.
## Version: 0.2.0
## SavedVariables: SpokenPartySyncDB
## OptionalDeps: Spoken, Spoken_Quests, Spoken_Zones, Spoken_Books
# Spoken is required at runtime and its modules are what there is to sync, but all four are
# optional here as they are for the modules themselves: an install missing the player loads,
# says what is missing, and does nothing, rather than failing to load at all. Listing them
# also makes them load first, so their sources are registered by the time this one looks.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken\icon.tga
## Group: Spoken

Locale\enUS.lua
Core.lua
Names.lua
Comm.lua
Peers.lua
Log.lua
Lines.lua
Sync.lua
Accept.lua
Room.lua
UI\Layout.lua
UI\Options.lua
UI\Window.lua
UI\UnitMenu.lua
Events.lua
Commands.lua

# Core first: every other file hangs its module off the table it builds. Comm before Peers and
# Sync, which register their message handlers with it. Events.lua is last but one because it is
# what calls Setup on everything above once the saved variables and the world are up.
